{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07330","headline":"硖石遇雨宴前主簿从兄子英宅 · 刘长卿","name":"硖石遇雨宴前主簿从兄子英宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县城苍翠里，客路两崖开。\n硖石云漠漠，东风吹雨来。\n吾兄此爲吏，薄宦知无媒。\n方寸抱秦镜，声名传楚材。\n折腰五斗间，僶俛随尘埃。\n秩满少余俸，家贫仍散财。\n谁言次东道，暂预倾金罍。\n虽欲少留此，其如归限催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}